flowchart LR
  %% QUESTION THIS DIAGRAM ANSWERS: which instrument does an agency use to pay, depending on who is paid and from which source?
  %% READING: left = the situation. Middle = the instrument. Right = the cash authority that it uses (see 05d).
  %% SOURCES: LDDAP-ADA as the general mode, replacing checks [CL2013-16A]. Advice to Debit Account recommended for payables [NBC599]. Advice of Checks Issued and Cancelled [eMDS]. Tax Remittance Advice, Non-Cash Availment Authority, Cash Disbursement Ceiling [NBC599]. Transfers to other agencies are not disbursements until used [NBC599 s.3.4]. Electronic transfer from BTMS [CL2025-8]. Government purchase card pilot with LBP [ROADMAP2024].
  %% GENERAL KNOWLEDGE, NOT OPENED IN A SOURCE HERE: the three kinds of cash advance and their liquidation, payroll credit through the bank, when a check is still used.

  S(["An approved<br/>disbursement voucher"]) --> Q{"Who is paid,<br/>and from what?"}

  Q -- "supplier or contractor<br/>with a bank account" --> I1["LDDAP-ADA<br/>list of due and demandable accounts payable,<br/>with advice to debit account.<br/>The bank credits each payee"]:::main
  Q -- "employees<br/>(salaries)" --> I2["Payroll credited to employee accounts<br/>through the servicing bank"]
  Q -- "payee that cannot be paid by<br/>bank credit" --> I3["MDS check, listed in the<br/>Advice of Checks Issued and Cancelled"]
  Q -- "many small payments, or<br/>payments outside the office" --> I4["Cash advance to a bonded officer<br/>(payroll in cash, petty cash,<br/>field operating expenses).<br/>The officer must liquidate (see 07f)"]
  Q -- "tax withheld from<br/>payments" --> I5["Tax Remittance Advice (TRA)<br/>recorded as paid to BIR, no cash moves"]
  Q -- "supplier of a foreign-assisted<br/>project, paid by the lender" --> I6["Direct payment by the lender.<br/>The agency only records it"]
  Q -- "another agency, a government<br/>corporation or a local government<br/>that will implement" --> I7["Fund transfer under an agreement.<br/>Not a disbursement of the source agency<br/>until the receiver uses it<br/>for accepted deliveries"]
  Q -- "agency that uses BTMS" --> I8["Electronic funds transfer from BTMS<br/>(PESONet, InstaPay), or check"]

  I1 --> A1["NCA in the MDS<br/>sub-account"]
  I2 --> A1
  I3 --> A1
  I4 --> A1
  I8 --> A1
  I5 --> A2["Tax Remittance<br/>Advice"]
  I6 --> A3["Non-Cash Availment<br/>Authority (NCAA)"]
  I7 --> A1

